# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# THE FILENAME IS WHY THIS FILE EXISTS. DO NOT "FIX" IT.
#
# This client reads a TOC by matching a fixed suffix it already knows, and the
# suffix it maps to Forever is _Camelot. A plain TASecretProbe.toc is never
# read here, so every file it listed went unloaded, SLASH_TASECRETPROBE1 was
# never assigned, and /tasp fell through to the game's own handler -- which is
# exactly the "nothing happens" and the "for help type /help" seen earlier.
# Same reason ToonAge ships ToonAge_Camelot.toc.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

TASecretProbe.lua
